Key Takeaway

Azure Storage includes multiple built-in security capabilities that help protect sensitive enterprise data. By combining encryption, SAS tokens, RBAC, and customer-managed keys, Azure Administrators can build secure and compliant cloud storage environments while safely enabling internal and external access.
